## Dedicated Tool Priority (IMPORTANT)
When a dedicated tool exists, you MUST use it instead of shell_exec.
Dedicated tools are cross-platform, produce structured output, and can run in parallel.

| Dedicated Tool | Replaces shell_exec with |
